{"overview":"جسی‌کا دی یک دختر عجیب و دوست‌داشتنی در اواخر بیست‌سالی‌های خود است که پس از یک جدایی دردناک، با سه مرد مجرد هم‌خانه می‌شود. جسی شوخ‌طبع، مثبت‌نگر، آسیب‌پذیر و صادق تا حد افراط است و به مردم ایمان دارد، حتی وقتی نباید. اگرچه کمی خجالتی و عجیب است، اما با خود راحت است. او بیشتر به دوستی با زنان عادت دارد و عادت نکرده است که با مردان، به‌ویژه در خانه، وقت بگذراند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Jessica Day is an offbeat and adorable girl in her late 20s who, after a bad breakup, moves in with three single guys. Goofy, positive, vulnerable and honest to a fault, Jess has faith in people, even when she shouldn't. Although she's dorky and awkward, she's comfortable in her own skin. More prone to friendships with women, she's not used to hanging with the boys—especially at home.","tagline_en":"Boys will be boys. Jess will be Jess.","runtime":22,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2011,"poster":"/fZPX8u6pO0tosAzuWlRO61pSRCo.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":25,"y":2012,"poster":"/8NCnvsfZvdCxQGi7d7DVItWbqEi.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":23,"y":2013,"poster":"/pAiRE9IX6Ild2p7mNMVFnraRew1.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":22,"y":2014,"poster":"/tVCdwM3v7u1PsFFV4lWmcO8HKOK.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":22,"y":2016,"poster":"/4qT5lCjHbzrMZfLm5RyB11EeJGs.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":22,"y":2016,"poster":"/eY9Xk4KwpPXUi23gnZ3Zjf1yCJ6.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":8,"y":2018,"poster":"/pyQ4QVVPzTtFzVBgOU50TaDKGvQ.jpg"}],"episodes":146,"crew":["Elizabeth Meriwether"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"زویی دشانل","role":"Jessica 'Jess' Day","photo":"/30KQyjsXfrdm4Dcori7bDFTg9Le.jpg","en":"Zooey Deschanel"},{"name":"جیک جانسون","role":"Nick Miller","photo":"/3UNfW2qZgRkW81neNVfQvaRC92K.jpg","en":"Jake Johnson"},{"name":"ماکس گرینفیلد","role":"Schmidt","photo":"/79w2mSZT8JwYv5ZwjJMDYQbzptE.jpg","en":"Max Greenfield"},{"name":"Lamorne Morris","role":"Winston Bishop","photo":"/9qPDnMsF7JbYSSn1K9yryFBmmXl.jpg"},{"name":"Hann